# Review queue (docs/review-queue.md): a PR touching these paths is full-review
# class and requests its owner automatically. The ruleset from
# .github/scripts/setup-review-queue.sh does not *require* code-owner approval:
# the owner authors most of these PRs and cannot approve their own, and in the
# apps these paths arrive through template-sync PRs already reviewed upstream.
# An app with other maintainers lists this file in sync.app_owned (app.yaml).
/src/workflow/   @t0mdavid-m
/.github/        @t0mdavid-m
/k8s/            @t0mdavid-m
/docker/         @t0mdavid-m
/Dockerfile*     @t0mdavid-m
